ease contact us at legal@talentech.com Do not sell or share my personal information Use necessary cookies only Allow selection Customize Allow all cookies Warning Your browser is outdated. Get the best experience with speed, security and privacy by using the latest version of Chrome, Firefox, Microsoft Edge, Safari or Opera × Søg job i Staten {1} ##LOC[OK]## {1} ##LOC[OK]## ##LOC[Cancel]## {1} ##LOC[OK]## ##LOC[Cancel]## Loading... Please login if you want to change your existing Job Agent subscription. Email Email address must be filled out Type in a valid email address in the field. (For example name@domain.com) First name First name can't be blank. Last name Last name can't be blank. Selected job categories All Ass. Professor/Postdoc Administration Craft Part time teaching/Research Exam Invigilator IT Management Associate Professor Open rank (Assistant, Associate, or full Professorship) Ph.d Professor Accounting Student Assistant Teaching Assistant Professor Teaching Associate Professorship Research Assistent Economy Research Assistent Security building operations Statens Rekrutteringsløsning is controller of the information you submit when registering a job agent via the recruitment system Talent Recruiter by Talentech. See our privacy policy for further information. When you subscribe for job ads through Talent Recruiter, you accept that we register your name and email address for the purpose of sending you personalised emails about relevant job openings. Your information is kept until you choose to unsubscribe. By submitting your personal data and application, you: declare that you have read, understood, and accepted the aforementioned Data Policy are giving your freely consent to the processing of the submitted and later collected information. I’ve read the above stated conditions and accept them. Please tell us that you are not robot. Tilgængelighedserklæring"
